{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act42side","storySort":1,"storyDependence":"act42side_level_act42side_st02","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"MT-5","storyName":"共融","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"拉特兰之外，产生了“堕天”症状的萨科塔们纷纷启程返回拉特兰。费德里科与阿尔图罗脱离“梦境”，拉特兰城内异象频生。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act42side/level_act42side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act42side_05","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["萨卡兹工人A","萨卡兹工人B","？？？","埃芒加德","萨卡兹工人们","塞茜莉亚","艾泽尔","弗莱蒙特","伊维格娜德","米夏埃尔","奥罗拉","帐篷里的声音","努艾达","费德里科","阿尔图罗","蒙恩的生物A","蒙恩的生物B"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_49_g2_kazdelstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人A","text":"喂，你赶着投胎啊，走这么快！我们抬的是一块源石结晶板欸，待会儿摔了就都死翘翘了。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_932_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人A","text":"这家人也真是的，用这玩意儿压菜缸，也不怕吃进嘴里的都是源石颗粒！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_932_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人B","text":"别*萨卡兹粗口*啰啰嗦嗦了，赶紧的。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_933_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人B","text":"今天之内清理完这个城区，这任务可不轻，你也不想头儿被那个老巫妖骂得臭血淋头后再把我们骂得臭血淋头吧。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_933_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人A","text":"这么多间屋子，要把沾着源石的地方都清理干净......巴别塔都组建了专门的城建队，为啥不干脆把它们推倒了重盖？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_932_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人A","text":"说起来，想到接下来哪哪儿都看不见源石，还真有点不适应。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_932_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人B","text":"闭上你那张臭嘴。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_933_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人B","text":"以前是没办法，只有靠着矿脉的产出才能活，现在卡兹戴尔已经不用再为能源发愁了，当然要把屋子打扫干净......","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_933_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人B","text":"你还真喜欢住在源石窝里头啊——喂，巫妖，看路！","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_933_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人A","text":"巫妖，收好你的线头，鬼知道你们那些线和源石打了结，会闹出什么乱子......","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_932_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这样说话很不礼貌哦。","id":32},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"真要缠住了，就用你们的角帮我勾断吧。不过那样的话，我的丝弦会不会把你们拖进别的空间里去呢？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人们","text":"......","id":43},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"charslot","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"好啦，不吓你们了。先生们，请过去吧~","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人A","text":"喂，是我眼花了吗？刚刚的光线是怎么回事？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_932_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人B","text":"前面的房子？过去看看。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_933_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"charslot","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"......让我去吧。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人A","text":"嗯？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_932_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"charslot","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"那排房子紧挨着刚整合完毕的农田地块，刚刚的光，应该是监测土壤的信标感应到了你俩搬的源石结晶板。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"要是维什戴尔知道这两年好不容易开垦的农田被污染......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_933_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹工人B","text":"走吧走吧。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_933_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"charslot","id":90},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_49_g1_kazdelroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":92},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":93,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_352_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞茜莉亚","text":"不、不要再往前了！","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_352_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4036_forcer_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾泽尔","text":"唔......","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4036_forcer_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"text","text":"埃芒加德看着面前紧张的小女孩，她尝试用自己小小的身子挡住来人的视线。","id":105},{"type":"text","text":"女孩身后，萨科塔男性脱力般跪在地板上，他的光环与光翼支离破碎，那些碎片像是活物般颤抖着，忽明忽暗，仿佛故障了的灯。","id":106},{"type":"text","text":"而萨科塔本人如同堕入了深深的梦中，不发一言。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_352_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞茜莉亚","text":"你是谁？你是来抓我们的吗？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_352_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"小女孩很紧张，埃芒加德弯下腰，用手撑着膝盖，尽量让自己看起来没有敌意，她甚至摇了摇自己充盈着能量的大尾巴。","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"可爱的小妹妹，我没有恶意。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"你刚刚应该听到了，我支开了其他的萨卡兹。或许我能帮你们......帮他。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_352_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞茜莉亚","text":"......","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_352_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"text","text":"埃芒加德关紧了身后的门，将可能的视线隔绝在外。","id":120},{"type":"dialog","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_4","volume":"1","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"她正了正自己的帽子，看不见的丝弦逶迤向不可知的空间。","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"1.5","id":129},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"1.5","id":130},{"type":"bg","id":131,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"1.5","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"老师。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#9$1","focus":"none","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗莱蒙特","text":"虽然高塔上那些繁文缛节和废话连篇的经卷真的倒人胃口，但对比现在，我真的得冲那对双子羊鞠躬，感谢她们的礼遇。","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗莱蒙特","text":"谁受得了每项政策都只能口头传达而且动不动还得翻来覆去解释好几遍，什么时候才能对我们的公务员进行普及教育......","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"急事。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#2$1","focus":"none","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗莱蒙特","text":"......说。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃芒加德","text":"我在节点炉这边发现了两个光环破碎的萨科塔......其中一个状态非常非常，不对劲。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_869_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_869_1#7$1","focus":"none","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗莱蒙特","text":"......","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗莱蒙特","text":"带他们回来，尽量别让其他人注意到，免得引起骚乱。","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗莱蒙特","text":"我去把维什戴尔踹醒。到了需要这个议长主持紧急会议的时候了。","id":147},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"curtain","id":153},{"type":"bg","id":154,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_44_g6_towerterrace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":156},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":157,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"......真是一份很长的名单啊。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"也就是说，就职于崔林特尔梅各个高塔的四十三名萨科塔，未经任何允许，全部擅自脱离了自己的岗位。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"是的，伊维格娜德。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"他们强行突破了厄登赫尔大区边检队的哨口，已经离开莱塔尼亚。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"莱塔尼亚无私地收容了这些离群者，可他们如今却选择叛逃......毫无征兆。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"倒也不能说毫无征兆。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"帝国音乐学院的守夜人目击到了一位萨科塔学者离开，他的光环和光翼都已经破碎......像是发生了很严重的意外。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"堕天？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"......不完全像。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"你认为应当如何处理呢？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"您——您在问我的意见？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"当然。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"米夏埃尔·沃尔夫冈，你现在是“无情权威”的代言人。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"除我之外，你是她留在世间唯一的声音。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"我......","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"和几年前比起来，你个子高了一些，心境成长了不少，希尔德加德把你教得很好。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"你今天能站在这里向我汇报所有的信息，值得赞誉。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"这意味着你向我坦白了自己有一些特别的渠道。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"莱塔尼亚的萨科塔集体“堕天”并叛逃，兹事体大......伊维格娜德，您是唯一有能力处理此事的人。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"作为奖励，我也不会介意你、乌提卡的那个孩子，甚至那个小伯爵私底下的一些动作。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"......","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"那么，让我们言归正传。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"边检队的报告中说，他们离去的方向，应该是拉特兰。这次叛逃事件极可能有拉特兰官方参与其中。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"是否需要派遣女皇之声，向教皇厅讨要说法？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"一年前，伊万杰利斯塔十一世曾在女皇庆典之后与我通信，他请求与莱塔尼亚携手并进。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"这群萨科塔如今的种种异常，或许说明，那场让教宗深为忌惮，不得不主动向我们寻求帮助的“灾异”，已经降临了。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"向所有高塔发出诏令，召集最优秀的术师与学者......以“永恒恩典”与“无情权威”共同的名义。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"灾难不会对这片大地的任何一处留私，我们需要尽快解读那自混沌中取来的秘密。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"是。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"我马上去安排。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"倒不用这么急。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"我、我的意思是，我去知会女皇之声，让她们去......","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"米夏埃尔，今天的晚霞也很美丽啊，陪我看看吧。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_487_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊维格娜德","text":"天空的伤口早已愈合......她也会喜欢现在的夜晚，对吧？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_487_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4109_baslin_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米夏埃尔","text":"......","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_4109_baslin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_bg_campsite_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":228},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":229,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"啧......","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"none","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帐篷里的声音","text":"......拉乌尼达东边的东边，白色的圣城，拉特兰♪","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帐篷里的声音","text":"那里的铳炮放出烟花，那里的靶子都是苹果♪","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帐篷里的声音","text":"当我们诚心祈祷，祂便给予面包♪","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帐篷里的声音","text":"当我们向祂奔去，祂便赐予救赎♪","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"唱吧，唱到睡着。","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"你们梦里的神可比拉特兰的主要仁慈。","id":242},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"charslot","id":244},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"守夜不需要跑这么远，奥罗拉。","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"......滚开。","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"这里已经是米诺斯的地界，辛嘉斯的那帮贵族佬不会再追过来，你们安全了。","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"修道院已经不复存在了，各奔东西吧。","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"十年前，你一声不吭地来到我的修道院，帮我把地块从那帮贵族手里保下来，如今你要离开，又是一声不吭。","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"你布你的道，我帮你保护那些孩子，换个落脚的地方，顺便而已。","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"别把自己看得太重要了。","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"奥罗拉......你不能离开。","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"奥罗拉，我不是在向你请求。","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"我们接下来的目的地相同，我们会与你结伴而行，一同去往拉特兰。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"我几时说过，回拉特兰要带着你们？","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"我们在一起十年了，奥罗拉。对羽蛇来说，这是很长很长的一段时光。","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"我或许确实没有那么相信拉特兰，可我总该相信你。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"拉特兰剥夺了你的公民身份，你无数次在我唱诗时咒骂那座城市......","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"可看看你自己，哪怕你已经在玻利瓦尔待了那么久，却还是不肯脱下这身铳骑的甲胄......","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"哪怕你已经成为堕天使，无法再使用守护铳，却依然想尽办法淘来了这架黑钢的铳械，你从来都没有——","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"闭嘴。","id":273},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"charslot","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_bigaxe_d","volume":"1","id":276},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"堕天使突然将武器往前送，漆黑的铳管几乎抵在了羽蛇的唇边。","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"你要是相信我，就该记得我告诉过你很多次，那座圣城没那么友爱，没那么仁慈和宽容......","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"从修道院跟着你走到这里的人，有一半都不是萨科塔。","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"离开玻利瓦尔后，你们有的是活路可找。","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"我们信的或许不是拉特兰真正的教条，但我们是凭着这信仰，才得以在玻利瓦尔那样混乱的地方勉强维持住还算有序的生活。","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"我没法说服大家离开玻利瓦尔后，不去朝圣......而是去其他地方。","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"同样，我也没办法说服我自己。历经漫长的岁月，拉特兰已经是我们的一部分了。","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"你在讲笑话吗......？","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"想想修道院里的萨科塔，他们不在拉特兰长大，莫名其妙堕天后，身心受到重创......","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"只有回到拉特兰，才能知道发生了什么，才能消除他们的恐慌，治好他们的“病”。","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"让我们再同行最后一段路吧，奥罗拉。","id":296},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"努艾达，我回拉特兰，可算不上思乡情切。","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"你知道吗？十年前，也是在一座修道院，有个老头对我说过类似的话，他曾代表拉特兰将我驱逐，因为一些可笑的过错。","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"他渴望从我嘴里听到一些忏悔，一些祈求。他告诉我，如果能够诚心忏悔，或许还有回去的机会......","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"你拒绝了？","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"我拒绝了。","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥罗拉","text":"那座城市想必出了不小的事，我回去，是要趁乱报复的。","id":310},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1.5","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"努艾达抬脸迎上冰冷的铳管，将它贴在脸侧。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"放心，我们不会妨碍你的。","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"我们只是需要一个领路人，一个知晓前方路途、能判明方向的人。","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4187_graceb_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"努艾达","text":"一个像你一样的人。","id":325},{"type":"dialog","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1782_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":328},{"type":"charslot","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"远处帐篷里的唱诗声渐弱，孩子们呼唤的声音三三两两地响起。","id":330},{"type":"text","text":"奥罗拉嗤笑一声，将铳收起。","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"charslot","id":336},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":338},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_act16side_01_intro","volume":"0.6","id":339,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":341},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_halogrow","volume":"1","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1791_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#8$1","duration":"1.5","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":356},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":358},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"1","id":359},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_halogrow","volume":"1","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1792_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"育婴圣堂在周围的建筑上涂抹出色彩，像是开启了一扇扇门，头顶光环的奇特生物从门后析出，一个接一个地落到地面。","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"......","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"除了那只木攀兽的幼崽，这些家伙，也得到了拉特兰的赐福？","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1791_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒙恩的生物A","text":"（激动地拍掌）","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1792_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒙恩的生物B","text":"（不安地摇晃）","id":377},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"charslot","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"他们匍匐在地，奋力向上摇晃着脑袋，似乎还不太适应头顶的光环。他们的喉头发出低沉而有规律的声响，连缀成一片，听来如同祷告。","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"唔，真是混沌的心声，难听。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"如果出于某种暂不明确的原因，圣城中的所有人此前都深陷于某种巨大的群体性幻觉中......","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"那么眼前的景象，是否意味着，真实与虚幻的界限被模糊了，实质性的灾难正在入侵拉特兰？","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"这比你我在帕维永中的经历更加难以理解。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"费迪，有只家伙已经注意到我们了。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sealangel","volume":"1","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1791_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒙恩的生物A","text":"（祷告声）","id":395},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"charslot","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我们发出的杂音，似乎惊扰了他们的仪式。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1791_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"仿佛是因为没有听见祷告声，一只蒙恩的生物扭头看向了费德里科与阿尔图罗。","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"他的光环闪烁，臃肿的身躯似乎也变得轻盈，他以极快的速度向两人靠近。","id":410},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dogangel_2","volume":"1","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1792_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1792_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":415},{"type":"charslot","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"费德里科举起铳，但头顶光环的生物对此视若无睹，他们的祷告声不曾有一刻停歇。","id":417},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"退后。这些物种的来历与属性尚不明确，别陷入包围。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我还以为你会毫不犹豫地射击。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"费迪，你说，这些家伙算是你我的同胞吗？如果你现在开火，是否会触犯律法？","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"这是玩笑，还是不合时宜的提问？","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"你的守护铳早已遗失，而我不需要开火也能制服这些生物。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"他们是否被算作同胞，虽有查明的必要，但并不是当前的优先事项。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"......","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"或许，有一个人能解开我们的所有困惑。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......教宗，伊万杰利斯塔十一世。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"charslot","id":436},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sealangel","volume":"1","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1791_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1791_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":440},{"type":"charslot","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_245_cello_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":443},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.5","focus":"l","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"走！","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"charslot","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":451},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":452},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":454},{"type":"image","id":455},{"type":"charslot","id":456}],"characters":["萨卡兹工人A","萨卡兹工人B","？？？","埃芒加德","萨卡兹工人们","塞茜莉亚","艾泽尔","弗莱蒙特","伊维格娜德","米夏埃尔","奥罗拉","帐篷里的声音","努艾达","费德里科","阿尔图罗","蒙恩的生物A","蒙恩的生物B"]}